// Syncthing ignore list for ghost-notes, for when this repository is shared as a Syncthing folder
// of its own (it was part of praxis's shared `axis` folder until 2026-10-06; these are ghost's
// lines from axis/.stignore).
//
// Everything here is either regenerable on the machine that needs it, or media far too large to
// be worth a phone's storage. Patterns without a leading slash match at any depth; a leading
// slash anchors to this folder's root. The (?d) prefix marks a pattern as deletable, so Syncthing
// may clean these up rather than refusing to remove a directory that contains them.

// --- big media and render artifacts -------------------------------------
// ghost exports its renders next to the project. ghost_4k.avi alone is 4.8G.
(?d)*.avi
(?d)*.mp4
(?d)*.mkv
(?d)*.mov

// The Mask Lab's working clips: Godot-transcoded .ogv plus extracted audio, ~3.2G. Regenerated
// by re-importing the source. Drop the three lines below to run the mask editor from the phone.
(?d)*.ogv
(?d)*.webm
(?d)*.wav

// yt-dlp's download cache for the YouTube import feature (~425M).
(?d)/masks/_downloads

// The feedback loop's per-iteration console dumps.
(?d)/feedback

// Builds (scripts/build.sh) and the hand-written bench scripts.
(?d)/dist
(?d)/build

// --- Godot ---------------------------------------------------------------
// Import cache, shader cache, editor layout, export credentials. Regenerated on first open.
(?d).godot
(?d)*.apk
(?d)*.aab
(?d)*.jks
(?d)*.keystore

// --- Python --------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.pyc
(?d).venv
(?d)venv

// --- editors and OS junk -------------------------------------------------
(?d).idea
(?d).vscode
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
